{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116833","id":3333500161,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7GsS0B","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116833","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116833.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116833.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116833","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116833/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116833/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116833/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0bd0454766b8d97134a61452152d55010de17bd8","number":116833,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":" Allow baking VoxelGI nodes off the main-thread ","user":{"login":"TitanNano","id":4500858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDA4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4500858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano","html_url":"https://github.com/TitanNano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Implementation of Proposal https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14243.\r\n\r\n`VoxelGI::bake` runs on and blocks the main thread. This makes it impossible to bake nodes without a visible freeze. It is also impossible to bake multiple nodes in parallel. Most modern machines should be capable of baking more than one `VoxelGI` node at the same time, which will considerably reduce bake times when doing so at runtime / in-game.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nComparison between sequential baking and parallel baking:\r\n\r\nExample project: [Sequential Baking of `VoxelGI` nodes](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25590176/voxel-gi-test-seq.zip)\r\n\r\n> VoxelGI baking took 205532 milliseconds\r\n\r\nExample project: [Parallel Baking of `VoxelGI` Nodes](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25590190/voxel-gi-test-par.zip)\r\n> VoxelGI baking took 3137 milliseconds\r\n\r\nWhen baking more than one VoxelGI node, doing it in parallel is significantly faster. My test with the two example projects was done on an MacBook M1 Pro.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**This PR relies on the changes from #116600 and contains the commit from the other PR.**\r\n\r\n- *Bugsquad edit:* This PR closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14243","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godote